# MegaLens — when to run (do not call wrong)

## Default = $0 (no MegaLens)
1. Read game logs yourself (see `read-game-logs-first.mdc`).
2. Static audit: grep wiring, install order, one `plugins.install`, 200-local budget.
3. Patch → bump version → user installs in Fluffy → user reproduces → read log again.

**Only then** consider L3. See `megalens-auditor.mdc` for tier voice + cost.

## Hard gates (all must pass before `megalens_debate`)
- [ ] User said yes with exact phrase: `run standard megalens, I accept ~$0.22`
- [ ] Game log first line = workspace `MOD_VERSION` (not old Fluffy build)
- [ ] Log shows `[QT] startup: state=` (init finished — not mid-crash)
- [ ] You have a concrete P0/P1 question (not "audit everything")

If any fail → **do not call MegaLens.**

## How to call (required)
```
megalens_debate:
  tier: standard
  mode: multi
  skill: code_intelligence
  fileContext: FULL FILE TEXT (never paths, never summaries)
  prompt: max 5–8 findings, file:line, P0/P1 only
```
Then `megalens_poll` until `terminal: true`. Read `billing.debit_committed` + `billing.cost_usd`.

## fileContext size (learned the hard way)
| Size | Result |
|------|--------|
| Paths / summaries | `MCP_BLOCKED` — **$0**, zero findings |
| All 5 split files (~200k chars) | Often `MCP_NEEDS_PLANNER_REPAIR` — **$0**, zero findings |
| **2–3 files (~80–120k)** | Best L3 hit rate |

**Preferred bundles (pick ONE per run):**
- **Wiring:** `quest_tracker.lua` + `quest_tracker_plugins.lua` + `quest_tracker_window.lua`
- **Steps:** `quest_tracker_cache.lua` + `quest_tracker_steps.lua` + `quest_data_loader.lua`

## After a run — before retry
1. `megalens_history` — if last run was `MCP_BLOCKED` or `MCP_NEEDS_PLANNER_REPAIR`, **do not retry same payload**.
2. Fix fileContext (smaller bundle or missing file text) OR fix code from static audit first.
3. Never retry L3 more than **once per session** without user re-approving spend.

## Status codes (what user pays)
| Status | Charged? | Action |
|--------|----------|--------|
| `MCP_BLOCKED` | No | Paste real code into `fileContext` |
| `MCP_NEEDS_PLANNER_REPAIR` | No | Smaller bundle; don't spam retries |
| `MCP_APPROVED` | Yes (~$0.12–0.30) | Fix P0/P1 only; bump version; Fluffy install |

## Never
- Call L3 before Fluffy install verified in log
- Put file paths in `fileContext` ("see quest_tracker.lua")
- Retry blocked runs hoping it works
- Use MegaLens as first step on a blank/broken mod (static + logs first)
